  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Against He Lang Zi in fragrant sorcerer yin statue wolf form charging a cloud building, Fang Yuan casts the immortal killer move from inside star cloud grindstone. He laughs and asks He Lang Zi to come in and fight as the grindstone and ropes drag the wolf in; Hui Feng Zi notes the two moves can coordinate.",
      "chapters": [
        876
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "move_star_cloud_grindstone",
        "char_hui_feng_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When the rope is coordinated with the grindstone, their power amplifies; the imperfect wolf transformation lacks strength, so the ropes pull it helplessly and tighten until marks form and bones creak. He Lang Zi’s lightning blast breaks the six ropes one by one and frees him. Star cloud grindstone, star snake rope, and six illusion star bodies all use Star Mark, Star Shoot, and Starlight from Star Lord Wan Xiang’s complete star path inheritance as cores and complement each other.",
      "chapters": [
        877
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coordination-and-cores",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_star_lord_wan_xiang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qin Bai Sheng disrupts or resists Lang Ya land spirit’s attacks; the land spirit’s fighting wisdom is very low. Fang Yuan’s coordination between grindstone and star snake ropes is much better, and the land spirit has much to learn.",
      "chapters": [
        881
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coordination-and-cores",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_bai_sheng",
        "char_lang_ya_land_spirit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the He Lang Zi fight, Fang Yuan lists star cloud grindstone, star snake rope, six illusion star bodies, and position star swap as the four star path immortal killer moves he can currently use from that inheritance.",
      "chapters": [
        886
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coordination-and-cores",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During freezing rain frozen earth, he sends a star snake rope to coil a key mortal Gu for research, but the Gu self-detonates and the rope misses.",
      "chapters": [
        889
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-attempts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_mortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Song Yi Shi’s stream veil, star snakes entangle the water capture method and vanish in a few breaths; he judges both are capturing methods, yet the gap is huge.",
      "chapters": [
        895
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "capture-attempts",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_yi_shi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "With star fire escape and projected star thought added, he controls six star path immortal killer moves total, still including star snake rope.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-path-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a later fight he first traps a yaksha octopus with star snake rope, then uses six illusion star bodies on the other.",
      "chapters": [
        932
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-path-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
